WEBVTT

NOTE
Battle of the Gardens — Galbadian mech-pods board Balamb Garden.
Duration: approximately 46 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.170
The two Gardens grind together.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.700
Green Galbadian mech-pods cling to Balamb Garden's curved hull.

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:25.240
They force their way inside.

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:37.420
One crashes into a Garden classroom, scattering desks and debris.
